    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The member is issued certain number of Borrower's Ticket (BT) for borrowing books. The BTs are NOT TRANSFERABLE and member is     responsible for any loss of book issued against his BT. On loss of BT member shall have to pay a fine of Rs.10/- per BT.",
          "mr": "The member is issued certain number of Borrower's Ticket (BT) for borrowing books. The BTs are NOT TRANSFERABLE and member is     responsible for any loss of book issued against his BT. On loss of BT member shall have to pay a fine of Rs.10/- per BT."
        },
        {
          "en": "If the book issued to the member is not returned on or before the due date, a late fee of Rs.1/- per day per book is charged. In case of    book issued for overnight is not returned next day, the late fee of Rs.2/- is charged per day per book.",
          "mr": "If the book issued to the member is not returned on or before the due date, a late fee of Rs.1/- per day per book is charged. In case of    book issued for overnight is not returned next day, the late fee of Rs.2/- is charged per day per book."
        },
        {
          "en": "Member should not mark, underline or highlight the words or sentences in the book by pencil or by ink.",
          "mr": "Member should not mark, underline or highlight the words or sentences in the book by pencil or by ink."
        },
        {
          "en": "The member is responsible for any damage caused to the book during the period it remains with him.",
          "mr": "The member is responsible for any damage caused to the book during the period it remains with him."
        },
        {
          "en": "Borrower shall examine the condition of book before getting it issued in his name. The last borrower will be held responsible for any    damage to the book.",
          "mr": "Borrower shall examine the condition of book before getting it issued in his name. The last borrower will be held responsible for any    damage to the book."
        },
        {
          "en": "Do not pull the book from the shelf by holding its back cover. To take out a book from the shelf, first push back two or three adjacent books    and then hold firmly the needed book at the middle of the spine and pull it lightly",
          "mr": "Do not pull the book from the shelf by holding its back cover. To take out a book from the shelf, first push back two or three adjacent books    and then hold firmly the needed book at the middle of the spine and pull it lightly"
        },
        {
          "en": "The book can be renewed for further period, if it is not required by any reader. The library has framed certain rules for circulation of books    so that all the members will have an equal opportunity to get the books. The membership is opened to bonafide students, faculty members    and ministerial staff. Members from different categories are entitled to get issued the books as follows:",
          "mr": "The book can be renewed for further period, if it is not required by any reader. The library has framed certain rules for circulation of books    so that all the members will have an equal opportunity to get the books. The membership is opened to bonafide students, faculty members    and ministerial staff. Members from different categories are entitled to get issued the books as follows:"
        }
      ],
      "order": 61
    }
  ],
