    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "en": "The books canbe consulted within the library and can also be issued to the readers for home reading.",
        "mr": "The books canbe consulted within the library and can also be issued to the readers for home reading."
      },
      "order": 56
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "en": "Considering the need of the students, library has made seating arrangement within 495 students at a time.",
        "mr": "Considering the need of the students, library has made seating arrangement within 495 students at a time."
      },
      "order": 57
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "en": "The library are provide separate reading room facility for registered girls & Ph.D students.",
        "mr": "The library are provide separate reading room facility for registered girls & Ph.D students."
      },
      "order": 58
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "en": "The University Library is kept open from 9.00 to 17.15 hrs throughout the year except Sundays and holidays. The University Library has also provided Reading Room Facility to the students, which is kept open from 6.00 hrs to 23.00 hrs.",
        "mr": "The University Library is kept open from 9.00 to 17.15 hrs throughout the year except Sundays and holidays. The University Library has also provided Reading Room Facility to the students, which is kept open from 6.00 hrs to 23.00 hrs."
